iscovery to source artifact targets from current refs plus current package-context members, omitting produced-only artifacts and zero-version targets.\"},{\"path\":\"apps/platform/client/features/review/artifact-review-panel.ts\",\"reason\":\"Clarified the bounded zero-version artifact review copy for direct empty-state review.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added server coverage for package-context-pinned artifact targets and zero-version omission from default review target discovery.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added server coverage for cross-process current/prior version review, pinned-context review access, unrelated produced-only artifacts staying unavailable, and explicit version requests against zero-version artifacts.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added client coverage for the bounded zero-version direct review state.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Added client API coverage to preserve ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND from artifact review responses.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Updated the zero-version panel expectation to the new bounded empty-state copy.\"},{\"path\":\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\",\"reason\":\"Registered package-context Convex handlers and updated integration coverage to the new process-context review rules while preserving package review behavior.\"}],\"tests\":{\"added\":[],\"modified\":[\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/artifact-review-panel.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"removed\":[],\"totalAfterStory\":566,\"deltaFromPriorBaseline\":8},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm exec vitest run tests/service/server/process-work-surface-api.test.ts tests/service/server/package-review-api.test.ts tests/service/server/review-export-api.test.ts tests/service/client/process-work-surface-page.test.ts tests/service/client/package-review-panel.test.ts\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"selfReview\":{\"passesRun\":0,\"findingsFixed\":[\"Removed the produced-by-process fallback that kept unrelated artifacts reviewable after they fell out of the current process context.\",\"Added package-context-pinned artifact eligibility for both workspace target discovery and direct artifact review.\",\"Preserved package review selected-member rendering by resolving pinned versions through a context-free version helper instead of the tightened direct artifact eligibility path.\",\"Covered zero-version edge cases end to end: omitted from default targets, bounded empty direct review state, and exact ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND for explicit version requests.\"],\"findingsSurfaced\":[]},\"openQuestions\":[],\"specDeviations\":[],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"Hand the story to verification/QA for focused review of Story 3 acceptance criteria and regression-check the review workspace flows against the new package-context and zero-version cases.\"},\"errors\":[],\"warnings\":[],\"artifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"result-envelope\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/liminal-build-wt-1/docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/03-process-scoped-artifact-review-realignment/001-implementor.json\"}],\"startedAt\":\"2026-04-26T22:38: