{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_76","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"artifactsRead\":[\"AGENTS.md\",\"convex/_generated/ai/guidelines.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-index.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-process-work-surface.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-tech-design.md\",\"docs/onboarding/current-state-code-map.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/stories/03-process-scoped-artifact-review-realignment.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-server.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/tech-design-client.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/test-plan.md\",\"docs/spec-build/v2/epics/05--artifact-model-and-review-provenance-alignment/artifacts/03-process-scoped-artifact-review-realignment/001-implementor.json\",\"apps/platform/server/app.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/routes/review.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/schemas/review.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/projects/platform-store.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/processes/process-work-surface.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/artifact-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/package-review.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/server/services/review/review-workspace.service.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/browser-api/review-workspace-api.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/artifact-review-panel.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/version-switcher.ts\",\"apps/platform/shared/contracts/review-workspace.ts\",\"tests/service/server/artifact-review-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/server/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-api.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/review-workspace-page.test.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\",\"tests/integration/review-workspace.test.ts\"],\"reviewScopeSummary\":\"Verified Story 3 across process-scoped review target discovery, direct artifact review resolution, explicit version and zero-version handling, review-workspace bootstrap behavior, and the new server/client/integration coverage added for cross-process and pinned-context review paths.\",\"priorFindingStatuses\":[],\"newFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-03-01\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Artifact version selection failures still collapse the review workspace instead of reloading bounded target state\",\"evidence\":\"`selectArtifactVersion` catches `ApiRequestError` from `getArtifactReview()` and only patches `reviewWorkspace.error` (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1019-1141`); it never reloads `/review` with the same selection. `renderReviewWorkspacePage` then short-circuits on any non-null `reviewWorkspace.error` and returns a failure section before rendering `availableTargets` or a bounded unavailable target (`apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts:223-236`). That means an `ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND` follow-up read loses the review target list and target-scoped degradation the Story 3 client design/test plan call for. The client tests added here only cover superseded success/error races (`tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts:127-301`), so this 404 recovery path remains unproven and currently incorrect.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"openFindings\":[{\"id\":\"SV-03-01\",\"severity\":\"major\",\"title\":\"Artifact version selection failures still collapse the review workspace instead of reloading bounded target state\",\"evidence\":\"`selectArtifactVersion` catches `ApiRequestError` from `getArtifactReview()` and only patches `reviewWorkspace.error` (`apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts:1019-1141`); it never reloads `/review` with the same selection. `renderReviewWorkspacePage` then short-circuits on any non-null `reviewWorkspace.error` and returns a failure section before rendering `availableTargets` or a bounded unavailable target (`apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts:223-236`). That means an `ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND` follow-up read loses the review target list and target-scoped degradation the Story 3 client design/test plan call for. The client tests added here only cover superseded success/error races (`tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts:127-301`), so this 404 recovery path remains unproven and currently incorrect.\",\"affectedFiles\":[\"apps/platform/client/app/bootstrap.ts\",\"apps/platform/client/features/review/review-workspace-page.ts\",\"tests/service/client/version-switcher.test.ts\"],\"requirementIds\":[],\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"blocking\":true}],\"requirementCoverage\":{\"verified\":[\"AC-3.1\",\"AC-3.2\",\"AC-3.3\",\"AC-3.4\",\"TC-3.1a\",\"TC-3.1b\",\"TC-3.2a\",\"TC-3.2b\",\"TC-3.3a\",\"TC-3.3b\",\"TC-3.4a\",\"TC-3.4b\",\"TC-3.4c\"],\"unverified\":[]},\"gatesRun\":[{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run green-verify\",\"result\":\"pass\"},{\"command\":\"corepack pnpm run verify-all\",\"result\":\"pass\"}],\"mockOrShimAuditFindings\":[\"`apps/platform/server/app.ts:154-182` still falls back to `NullPlatformStore` when live Convex config is absent; that repo-wide shim leaves review surfaces empty outside configured runtimes, but it was not introduced by Story 3.\",\"Reviewed Story 3 production paths do not add new mocks/fake adapters; `InMemoryPlatformStore`, test auth doubles, and fake browser transports remain confined to test-only surfaces.\"],\"recommendedNextStep\":\"revise\",\"recommendedFixScope\":\"same-session-implementor\",\"openQuestions\":[],\"additionalObservations\":[\"Server-side Story 3 behavior is well covered: cross-process artifact review, pinned package-context eligibility, zero-version omission from target discovery, bounded empty direct review, and exact `ARTIFACT_VERSION_NOT_FOUND` responses are all exercised in service and integration tests.\",\"Both requested gates passed, but `guard:no-test-changes` and `test:e2e` are still scaffolded skip commands rather than substantive verification lanes.\"]}"}}
